[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ホントにここでいいの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you sure this is the right place?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "多分間違いないわ。あの時倉庫で聞いた話だと、\n団長と神官長は島に戻るって言ってたから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pretty sure. Back at the warehouse, they said the leader and High Priest were returning to the island."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "問題はどこにいるかだよな。\n結構見通しも悪いしよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Problem is finding where they are. Visibility's not great around here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、それもそうですね。うぅ……本当に\n高濃度マナ領域そっくりです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yes, that's true. Ugh... It's just like being in a manabound area."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふぇっ！\u3000これはあの時の果物！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eep! Is that the fruit from before?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くせぇな！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That stinks!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "実はね、この匂いを団長に擦り付けておいたのよね。\nだ・か・ら、レイニャ。これの匂いを追って",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I may have rubbed some of this scent on our leader earlier. So, Lenja, think you can track it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすがです、ニーナさん！\nそれなら団長さんの居場所が追えますね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's brilliant, Miss Nina! Now we can track down where the leader went!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へぇ。レイニャちゃんって鼻が利くんだ～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh wow, I didn't know you had such a good nose, Lenja!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はいっ！\u3000くんくん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! *sniff sniff*..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たどれそうです！\u3000皆さん、付いて来てください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can track it! Everyone, follow me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、鼻が曲がった……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh, my nose is gonna fall off..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]